# Copy to .env and fill in. Loaded via python-dotenv.

# --- Required ---
# OpenRouter API key. Used by the LLM planner (FX selection) and parameter init.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# --- Optional ---
# Reverb impulse-response length in samples for the DASP NoiseShapedReverb.
# Default 8192 (~0.19s) is CPU-safe but the reverb tail is barely audible, so
# decay_time has almost no effect. On a GPU / large-RAM machine set a longer IR
# for an audible space:
#   65536  ~1.5s   (good starting point)
#   131072 ~3.0s   (cathedral)
# 65536+ tends to OOM on a CPU-only box. Affects both demo generation and the
# demo build. Export it in your shell so both scripts see it (see below).
# REVERB_NUM_SAMPLES=131072
